    "Calculate daily compound interest with daily, weekly, or monthly additions. See how day-by-day compounding accelerates your savings balance.": "毎日の複利計算と日次・週次・月次の追加積立を試算。日歩複利が資産残高をどのように加速させるかを確認できます。",
